name":"Luca Guastini","role":"Termini Kid (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RislY3NWP951QCuYpC3ypColzE.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Nel novembre 1975 a Roma, in una Italia persa, corrotta e divorata dalla paura della verità, Pier Paolo Pasolini, che sta terminando il capolavoro Salò, trascorre le sue ultime ore nella casa di famiglia, scrivendo lettere e concedendo un'intervista a Furio Colombo. Avvertito dai suoi più cari amici, che lo mettono in guardia e lo invitano a smettere di scrivere i suoi incendiari articoli contro le ingiustizie di potere, Pasolini si appresta a uscir la sera a bordo della sua Alfa Romeo in cerca di avventura."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"We are with Pasolini during the last hours of his life, as he talks with his beloved family and friends, writes, gives a brutally honest interview, shares a meal with Ninetto Davoli, and cruises for the roughest rough trade in his gun-metal gray Alfa Romeo. Over the course of the action, Pasolini’s life and his art are constantly refracted and intermingled to the point where they become one.","tagline":"A kaleidoscopic look at the last day of Italian filmmaker Pier Paolo Pasolini in 1975."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9A68iTPy5gQbp3AD2wfUh7EqGU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rpJwtIXntYcKRONrT5EKSAMX1o.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":283700,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9A68iTPy5gQbp3AD2wfUh7EqGU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s9A68iTPy5gQbp3AD2wfUh7EqGU.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9A68iTPy